# Cucut Architecture

## Pipeline

```text
scan (freezedetect) → segments.csv → [review] → trim (-c copy concat)
                              ↓
                    export → LosslessCut CSV → gui
```

## Layer rules

- **Core logic** (`segments.py`, `csvio.py`) — pure Python, no subprocess, fully unit-tested
- **I/O edge** (`ffmpeg.py`) — all ffmpeg/ffprobe subprocess calls
- **Orchestration** (`scan.py`, `trim.py`, `export.py`) — compose core + I/O
- **CLI** (`cli.py`) — thin argparse wrapper, no business logic

## Adding features

| Feature | Where |
|---------|-------|
| New detect filter/param | `ffmpeg.py` + `scan.py` + CLI flags |
| New CSV column | `csvio.py` + migration note in CHANGELOG |
| Scene-change pad | new module `scene.py`, called from `scan.py` |
| New export format | new `export_*.py` or extend `export.py` |

## External tools

- **LosslessCut** — visual review + lossless export (via `export` + `gui`)
- **frame-checker** — optional batch scan GUI (`gui --tool frame-checker`)
